<title>ITALY: Italy records April bop deficit of 2.144 trln lire.</title>
<headline>Italy records April bop deficit of 2.144 trln lire.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italy's overall balance of payments recorded a 2.144 trillion lire deficit in April, the Italian Foreign Exchange Office said.</p>
<p>BALANCE OF PAYMENTS (In trillions of lire)</p>
<p>			     April 97     March 97    April 96</p>
<p> Total		     -2.144	 -3,896     +8.043</p>
<p>  -Year to date	  -2.675	 -531	 +8.459</p>
<p> Capital movements     -4.343	 -192	 +1.216</p>
<p>  -Year to date	  +8.794	 +13,137    +5.394</p>
<p>-- Rome newsroom +396 678 2501</p>
</text>
